  "recipe": {
    "positive": "Visual style (follow exactly): A poster built almost entirely from one oversized bold Chinese character or short phrase filling the frame, set on a flat saturated background with a single contrasting accent shape, tight tracking, typographic impact; every stroke needed to read the lettering stays fully visible and inside the canvas; the lettering is the image, no illustration.",
